# Technology Stack — Shortly

| Layer | Technology | Role |
|---|---|---|
| **Language** | JavaScript (JSX) | No TypeScript, ESM |
| **Runtime** | React 19 | React Compiler enabled |
| **Build** | Vite + Babel | Dev server & bundler |
| **Styling** | Tailwind CSS v4 + DaisyUI | CSS-first + themes |
| **State** | Zustand | Global state |
| **Icons** | Iconify | SVG icon library |
| **Notifications** | sileo | Via adapter (`_core/utils/toast/`) |
| **Routing** | React Router v7 | Nested layouts |
| **Class Utils** | clsx + tailwind-merge | `cn()` utility |
| **Variants** | CVA | Component variations |
| **Lint/Format** | ESLint + Prettier | Flat config, Tailwind plugin |
| **Deploy** | gh-pages (`/shortly/` base) | GitHub Pages |

> Exact versions in `package.json`.

## Non-obvious Rules

- **React Compiler** → no manual `useMemo`/`useCallback`/`React.memo`. `react/prop-types` off.
- **Toast** always through `_core/utils/toast/toast-adapter.js` — never import sileo directly.
- **No TypeScript** — plain JS. JSDoc only for cross-module types.
- **Font-weight normal = 500** (Poppins TTF, not 400).
- **Base path** `/shortly/` — use `import.meta.env`, never hardcode.
